{"title": "Overtrading", "type": "Trading mistake", "hooks": ["Stop trading every wiggle. Take fewer, better trades instead.", "More trades doesn't mean more profit. Here's why.", "Stop trading every wiggle. Wait for 1 setup instead."], "scenes": [{"kind": "hook", "vo": "Stop trading every wiggle. Wait for 1 setup instead.", "text": "Stop trading every wiggle", "chart": 0, "win": [8, 90], "show": 78}, {"kind": "chart", "chart": 0, "head": "Every wiggle, a trade?", "show": 40, "vo": "Overtrading looks like this. Beamline Couriers swings up to 49.61, down to 47.52, up again, down to 46.50. A beginner trades every turn.", "cues": [{"say": "up to 49.61", "do": "reveal", "to": 44}, {"say": "down to 47.52", "do": "reveal", "to": 46}, {"say": "down to 46.50", "do": "reveal", "to": 61}, {"say": "trades every turn", "do": "shade", "from": 44, "to": 61, "tone": "amber"}], "win": [8, 90]}, {"kind": "cards", "head": "What it costs", "vo": "Each trade has costs. More trades mean more chances to make a mistake. And nobody calls the next few candles much better than a coin.", "items": [{"text": "Costs add up", "sub": "every trade has a cost", "icon": "coin"}, {"text": "More mistakes", "sub": "more trades, more chances to slip", "icon": "warn"}, {"text": "A coin flip", "sub": "the next few candles are noise", "icon": "cross"}], "cues": [{"say": "Each trade has costs", "do": "item", "i": 0}, {"say": "make a mistake", "do": "item", "i": 1}, {"say": "better than a coin", "do": "item", "i": 2}], "chart": null}, {"kind": "big", "text": "Fewer, better trades", "vo": "The fix is fewer, better trades. Wait for your setup, size it properly, and be happy to skip a day.", "chart": null}, {"kind": "outro", "text": "One go a day", "vo": "The Daily Chart gives you one go a day to practise patience, at memestreet.net.", "chart": null}], "caption": "More trades doesn't mean more profit.\n\nOvertrading means jumping in on every wiggle. Every trade has costs, and more trades means more chances to ma